  m_Name: Mimi the Nerdy NPC - Quest - Find Siss - Complete
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueID: Mimi the Nerdy NPC - Quest - Find Siss - Complete
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1964226d4f853d248af65a60e0a53924, type: 2}
    textENG: Huzzah! The triad is complete.
    textPL: Hura! Triada jest kompletna.
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1964226d4f853d248af65a60e0a53924, type: 2}
    textENG: 'The knowledge you seek: the train at the station is numbered 4649.

      Maybe
      it means something?'
    textPL: "Wiedza, kt\xF3rej szukasz: poci\u0105g na stacji ma numer 4649.\r\nMo\u017Ce
      to co\u015B znaczy?"
    expressionName: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b90acb33a755d494cafdd1d36518e58b, type: 2}
    textENG: "I didn\u2019t expect to do all of that for a train number\u2026"
    textPL: "Nie spodziewa\u0142em si\u0119, \u017Ce zrobi\u0119 to wszystko dla
      numeru poci\u0105gu\u2026"
    expressionName: 
